Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.27,0:00:12.95,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Twilight... You've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:16.87,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,By being in the Forger household, \Nyou've gained unnecessary emotions,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:19.99,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,and your cunning as an agent has dulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:23.66,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Right now, you're like a chipped knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:26.25,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Seeing you like this makes my heart ache.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.25,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.79,0:00:30.96,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,But his gentle version is wonderful, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.14,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,My heart's beating so fast, I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.59,0:00:34.55,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,I love him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:38.26,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Even if he became one of those toy knives \Nthat retract when you stab something,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:40.26,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,I would continue to respect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:43.81,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Actually, a bouncy Twilight would \Nbe so adorable. I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:47.15,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,But things cannot stay like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:50.90,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should make him bouncy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.73,0:00:53.07,italics,Fiona,0,0,0,,Yor Forger...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:57.61,italicstop,Fiona,0,0,0,,I must steal the title of "wife" from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:58.03,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(270,290)\fscx47}THE UNDERGROUND TENNIS TOURNAMENT: THE CAMPBELLDON
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:02.49,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Well, apparently I've discovered that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:05.58,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I can take these yawn-filled days
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:08.54,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And turn them into movies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.55,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I've found the secret and trick to it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:14.51,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Under this sky where we don't get along
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:17.59,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I closed my heart and locked it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.59,0:01:20.64,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That's how I've managed to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:22.64,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And the melodies now overlap
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:29.40,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I wanted a sign, no matter how small
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:36.32,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That I could actually find \Nbetter than any streetlight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.82,0:01:43.20,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I put a ribbon on each of the \Nsights that my eyes pick out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:49.12,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And I collect them like souvenirs \Nas I continue down this path home
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.12,0:01:55.13,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,The seasons each say hello, \Nand I shed a few tears as I go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.13,0:02:01.39,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Where should I begin to talk about \Nthis way home that you've given me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:09.52,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I walk and walk and sometimes \Nrush on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:21.70,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I run and run, wait, no, I should \Nstill walk on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.42,0:02:32.00,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Cavi Campbell, age 56.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:34.75,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,He gained his fortune through \Nthe energy business,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:38.01,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,and he's also known to be an \Navid collector of antiques.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.59,0:02:42.01,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,The painting he possesses that \Nis valued at a million dalc,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.01,0:02:45.85,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Lady in the Sun{\i0}, is our \Ntarget for this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.02,main,Loid,0,0,0,,A painting...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:51.01,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,The original owner was the \Nlate Colonel Erik Zacharis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.56,0:02:54.90,main,Loid,0,0,0,,He belonged to the East's military intelligence \Ndivision in the war between the East and West.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:57.03,main,Loid,0,0,0,,He was also a major player \Nin ending the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:02:58.40,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:02.36,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,He's said to be in possession of some \Ntroublesome top-secret information
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:06.99,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,that was cast into darkness because it could \N"reignite the flames of war" if it went public.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.37,0:03:09.79,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Otherwise known as the Zacharis Dossier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:14.25,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,It's said that the dossier could contain \Nrecords of the East's human experiments
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:17.25,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,or the truth behind the \NWest's massacre of POWs,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.25,0:03:18.67,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,but the truth is unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:21.51,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,It's also known as the \N"ticking time bomb under thin ice."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:24.01,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Its whereabouts were long \Nshrouded in mystery, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.35,0:03:28.27,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Clues regarding said whereabouts\Ncan be found in the painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:30.93,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,This information comes from \Na well-connected source.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.93,0:03:33.77,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,We believe there might be \Nsome kind of code within it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:36.61,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before \Nthe painting's owner, Campbell,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:39.61,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,or the Eastern government realizes \Nthe truth behind the painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:43.78,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Our orders are to retrieve the \NZacharis Dossier before they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:47.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Regardless of whether the information it \Ncontains is inconvenient to the East or West,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:52.58,main,Loid,0,0,0,,we can be certain that this information would \Nbecome a reason for them take up arms again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:54.71,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Where is the painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:58.38,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,It's located in the basement of the Campbell \Nmansion along with his other art pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:00.44,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,But on top of tight security, \NCampbell also has
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:02.34,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,connections to the State Security Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:05.97,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Any "vermin" that sneak in are\N exterminated without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:08.64,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,It will be very risky for us to infiltrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:10.85,main,Loid,0,0,0,,So do we have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:13.69,main,Fiona,0,0,0,,Of course. I have one ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.45,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,Game set!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.75,0:04:35.25,main,Audience A,0,0,0,,You can't be serious! Gimme my money back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:38.50,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The payout for that match is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:39.25,top,Audience B,0,0,0,,You call that a match?! Make it \Nup to me even if you die first!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.71,0:04:43.22,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The cutoff to place your bets for \Nthe next match is in ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:45.22,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Nightfall...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:46.84,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Yes, Twilight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:49.51,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Was there really no other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.51,0:04:51.72,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,This was the most certain method.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:54.56,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,There is an underground tennis tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:59.02,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,run by Campbell for himself and other \Nmembers of his underground tennis club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:00.52,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,It's known as the Campbelldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:03.40,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Elites of the financial world \Nand members of the underworld
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:05.74,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,gather for this expensive and illegal event.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:10.53,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Ordinarily, celebs enter their own \Npersonal players to compete,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.53,0:05:14.83,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,but normal civilians can also enter as long \Nas they pay an incredibly high entry fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:19.96,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,And... the winner is free to choose \Nwhatever art piece they want
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:22.30,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,from Campbell's collection as a prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:27.68,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Yes... But why tennis? What in the \Nworld is an underground tennis club?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:29.57,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I just figured he's really into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:33.93,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,All we have to do to complete this mission \Nis win, so there are no risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:36.14,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I hope everything actually \Ngoes that smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:40.48,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Next up, we have the fourth match \Nof our first round with...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.27,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The Twain and Nafalia Phony pair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.27,0:05:43.40,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,We're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.94,0:05:46.99,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Apparently, this pair is husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.15,0:05:48.16,top,Crowd,0,0,0,,I'll blow you to smithereens!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:48.95,main,Crowd,0,0,0,,Piss off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:50.74,top,Crowd,0,0,0,,I bet 100 dalc that they divorce!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.03,0:05:51.95,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Why on earth did you pick this as our cover?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.95,0:05:55.45,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Ah... So many people are seeing \Nus as husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:58.33,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,They'll be going up against \Nthe Wolson and Babol pair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:06:02.00,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The legendary pair that dominated \Nthe Grand Slam ten years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:05.42,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Hey, they're actual retired pro players.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:07.51,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Do you have any experience playing tennis?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:11.72,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I've only dabbled in it. \NI just practiced a bit at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:14.97,flashback,Anya,0,0,0,,No fair! Anya wants to play tennis, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:17.72,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,Then why don't we all play together?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:20.47,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,What did you tell your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:23.77,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I just told them we were \Nhaving a tennis competition
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:26.57,main,Twain,0,0,0,,with some of our business \Npartners in the medical field.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.57,0:06:27.78,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:32.61,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Eventually, you won't have to make \Nexcuses like that, Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.98,0:06:34.95,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:38.04,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,You could just stay huddled \Nin the back corner if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:42.42,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,This mission will show you \Nthat I am the perfect fit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:45.50,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,to play your wife for Operation Strix.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:48.22,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I can take care of this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:50.68,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,You can count on me, Twilight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:53.89,flashback,Senior agent,0,0,0,,Nightfall's been getting a bit \Ntoo eager to get ahead lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:55.51,flashback,Senior agent,0,0,0,,Watch over her so she doesn't mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.51,0:06:57.52,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,What a troublesome mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:07:00.73,italicstop,Commentator,0,0,0,,The odds are an amazing 40 to 1.3!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.73,0:07:05.15,italicstop,Commentator,0,0,0,,Do we have any brave souls \Nwilling to bet on this couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:06.53,main,Wolson,0,0,0,,They're clearly underestimating \Nus with this pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:09.36,main,Babol,0,0,0,,Did they wander in here thinking \Nit was a tourist attraction?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:14.12,main,Wolson,0,0,0,,We've continued the pursuit of tennis \Neven after our retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:15.95,main,Babol,0,0,0,,We wanted to face stronger opponents,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:18.37,main,Babol,0,0,0,,and that's how we found \Nthis underground arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.62,0:07:23.38,main,Wolson,0,0,0,,We holed up in the mountains and endured \Nrigorous training just for this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:27.63,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Well, let's all do our best \Nand have a brilliant match.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.63,0:07:33.14,main,Wolson,0,0,0,,Match? You fool. What's about to \Nunfold here is an absolute slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:36.85,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,Phony to serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:49.65,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,15-love!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:54.20,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,He managed a service ace right \Noff the bat against a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:58.45,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Well done, Twilight. \NYou've redefined "dabbled." I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:02.41,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,30-love!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.45,0:08:04.42,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,40-love!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:07.92,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,Game set!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:10.30,main,Babol,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:13.34,main,Babol,0,0,0,,I've never even seen a top-ranked \Nplayer serve like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:17.35,main,Wolson,0,0,0,,Curses... The woman. Aim for the woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:19.10,main,Wolson,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:24.27,main,Babol,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.81,0:08:27.11,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,Love-15.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:28.36,main,Babol,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.73,0:08:31.49,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Nice work, Ni—Nafalia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:32.86,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,He complimented me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:33.99,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,We're just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:37.37,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll just have to keep \Nshowing him how amazing I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:40.48,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,immediately crush the enemy, \Nand get the painting fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:45.87,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Fantastic, Nightfall! Let us play\Ndoubles in the game of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.17,0:08:50.25,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Oh, Twilight! You flatter me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:02.64,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,Game set! The winners are the Phony pair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.64,0:09:04.85,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,That was one hell of an upset!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:08.61,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The amateur couple that showed up out of \Nnowhere just annihilated the pro players!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:11.36,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,An unbelievable dark horse has appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:16.61,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Was this result just a fluke? \NThis tournament could get very interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:19.99,main,Campbell,0,0,0,,How splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.99,0:09:22.49,main,Campbell,0,0,0,,This turn of events may \Nmake us quite a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:26.63,main,Member A,0,0,0,,Now, no rigging any matches, Mr. Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:31.34,main,Member B,0,0,0,,We want to enjoy the pure \Nart of betting on tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:35.01,main,Member C,0,0,0,,Hmph. This is what happens when \Nyou play against normies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:39.21,main,Member C,0,0,0,,They'll be playing against my Boric \NBrothers next. There'll be no flukes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.21,0:09:42.39,main,Member A,0,0,0,,Well, you've just got a pair of junkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.31,0:09:45.68,main,Member C,0,0,0,,Oh, you haven't seen anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:48.06,main,Member C,0,0,0,,We've been developing a new \Ndoping agent called OSO-R
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:52.02,main,Member C,0,0,0,,along with the government in preparation for \Nthe upcoming East-West Sports Exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:54.65,main,Member C,0,0,0,,They'll be using that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:10:01.95,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting, ladies and gentlemen. \NWe will now begin the second round!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:06.43,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Our first match will feature the Phony pair,\N who just wowed us with a miracle,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.43,0:10:11.04,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,playing against Dressen's Mad Dogs,\N the Boric Brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:15.17,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Nafalia, didn't you say \Nsomething about no risks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:17.68,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Let's just do our very best, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.97,0:10:25.56,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama! Get the ball, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.98,0:10:27.56,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.81,0:10:31.56,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.44,0:10:36.20,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama's lost in tots?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.69,0:10:39.11,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Th-That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:46.64,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,If he's at a tennis tournament with colleagues,\N does that mean she's there, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.86,0:10:49.79,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I wonder what her relationship with Loid is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:56.21,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What if I go back to a life where \NYuri is constantly worried about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:10:57.97,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.97,0:11:02.30,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,If that could happen, \Nmaybe I should take care of her...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:05.26,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.26,0:11:09.03,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,You'll be punished for \Nthinking such thoughts, Yor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:13.90,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama, it's okay. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:15.77,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What? Worry about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.19,0:11:18.69,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Does she know what I'm thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.11,0:11:24.53,main,Anya,0,0,0,,D-Don't worry. Papa will win and \Nbring home a fabulous prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:25.62,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:27.75,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:33.74,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right. \NLoid is capable of anything, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.74,0:11:36.71,main,Yor,0,0,0,,He'll take care of any opponent with a kapow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.71,0:11:38.26,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Kapow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:40.50,main,Anan,0,0,0,,Kill... Tennis...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.09,0:11:49.22,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Nafalia... Those definitely don't seem like\N the same Boric Brothers from round one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.22,0:11:51.77,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I forgot to mention this, \Nbut in this tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:54.77,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,you can customize your rackets\N and equipment, get doped up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:55.98,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,perform illegal moves...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:57.77,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Pretty much anything goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.07,0:12:00.61,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,They must have taken muscle enhancers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:02.78,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Uh, that would be an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:04.53,main,Audience C,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you giant meatheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:06.41,main,Audience C,0,0,0,,I bet an ungodly amount of money on you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:07.41,main,Audience D,0,0,0,,I'll murder you if you lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:09.16,main,Catan,0,0,0,,Kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.54,0:12:10.91,main,Audience E,0,0,0,,Uh, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:17.17,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Oh, my! The younger brother, Catan,\N has ripped the fence apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:18.50,main,Catan,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:19.84,main,Anan,0,0,0,,Just shut up and watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:21.38,top,Audience F,0,0,0,,Y-You freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:22.30,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Behold their monstrous strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:25.43,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,And betting time is just about over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:27.30,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The Phony pair who showed \Nus a miracle last round!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:31.31,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The ultra-powerful Boric Brothers!\N Who will be victorious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:29.85,top,Audience G,0,0,0,,I-I'm gonna bet on those brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:31.81,top,Audience H,0,0,0,,No human could possibly beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:34.60,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,Well, their immense power is \Ngoing to be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:37.44,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,How do we fight them while\N preserving our stamina?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:46.99,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Oho! This time the older brother, \NAnan, easily crushed a ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:48.95,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Let's take good care of the equipment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.95,0:12:50.08,main,Anan,0,0,0,,Hey, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:53.08,main,Anan,0,0,0,,You sorta smell like piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:57.46,main,Anan,0,0,0,,If you pissed your pants, \Nhave that chick change your diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:12:59.84,main,Catan,0,0,0,,Piss! Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:01.59,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I would be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:06.05,main,Anan,0,0,0,,What? Cat got your tongue, you chickenshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:09.93,main,Catan,0,0,0,,Bro! He's real dumb! He can't use his words!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.93,0:13:13.77,main,Anan,0,0,0,,Yeah, he does look pretty brainless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:17.60,main,Anan,0,0,0,,He probably lived a peaceful life \Nwithout ever having to think at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.49,0:13:31.91,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,Game set! The winners are the Phony pair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:36.96,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The real deal! This couple is \Ndefinitely the real deal, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:40.25,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The Boric Brothers were beaten to a pulp\N before they could even make a move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:41.92,top,Crowd,0,0,0,,You stupid useless walking Mount Everests!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:43.80,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Goodness, you could really feel the\N malice from the Phonys' play there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:46.51,main,Twain,0,0,0,,You didn't have to hit them \Nwith that many smashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:48.59,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,My hand just kept slipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:50.76,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Certain death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.76,0:13:53.35,main,Member C,0,0,0,,My trump cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:57.52,main,Campbell,0,0,0,,I guess your medicine might \Nneed a few more improvements.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:14:00.27,main,Member A,0,0,0,,I must say, they're quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:03.23,main,Member A,0,0,0,,You might be in some \Ntrouble yourself, Mr. Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.65,0:14:06.95,main,Campbell,0,0,0,,Well... I'm not so sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:13.45,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,After that, thanks to Nightfall's unnecessary\N showing off and powerful moves,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:14.45,italicstop,Nafalia,0,0,0,,How am I doing, Twilight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.45,0:14:16.25,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,the Phony pair continued their steady advance,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.91,0:14:16.25,italicstop,Nafalia,0,0,0,,How am I doing, Twilight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:19.67,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and made it to the finals safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.67,0:14:26.76,main,Guide,0,0,0,,If you would, wait here for about \Ntwenty minutes until the finals start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:35.81,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Just one more step.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:41.81,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Twilight, how did you like \Nmy flawless plays? Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:45.73,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Apparently, we'll be facing Campbell's\N son and daughter in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:48.78,main,Twain,0,0,0,,They're still in high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:52.28,main,Twain,0,0,0,,but they've trained with the best \Nin tennis ever since they were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.70,0:14:54.35,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Their father runs this tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:57.75,main,Twain,0,0,0,,so let's be on our guard, just in case \Nthey try to do something underhanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:15:02.00,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Judging from their matches so far,\N they aren't that skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:03.75,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I'll end this match in seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:08.22,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,And then, I'll have him choose me as his\N doubles partner in the game of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:09.34,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.47,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Nightfall...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:13.51,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Twilight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.89,0:15:16.77,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Wait, already?! Right here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:21.52,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Twilight, I'm not ready just yet! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.77,0:15:24.52,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Stop pushing yourself. Your hand's all torn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:25.48,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:28.99,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Our opponents won't be that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:31.02,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I don't blame you for panicking, \Nbut take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.57,0:15:33.62,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.12,0:15:36.04,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Let us hurry and finish this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.20,0:15:42.37,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I've seen many allies die \Nexactly for that reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:48.55,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Spies are finished once they lose their cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.96,0:15:51.68,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I've told you that countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.51,0:15:55.76,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.43,0:15:57.89,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Twilight...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:15:59.10,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,You used to say
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:02.31,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,that us spies are disposable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:05.06,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,And yet he's worrying about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:11.82,sign_26518_282_Love_Love_Love,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(105,135)\t(1,5750,\frz360)}Love\NLove Love
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.44,0:16:09.23,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,How dare you, Twilight? \NYou're not playing fair at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.23,0:16:11.82,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I love you, I love you, I love you, \NI love you, I love you, I love you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:14.74,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,She's glaring daggers at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.74,0:16:17.20,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,Does she doubt my methods that much?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:20.91,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it. I pulled my hand away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.91,0:16:22.08,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I'm so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:26.46,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Twilight's warmth still stings a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:27.59,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,It stings?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:30.59,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.47,0:16:33.68,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Twilight...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:36.22,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Hold your breath and \Nclose your eyes, Nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.47,0:16:38.01,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Colorless and odorless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.01,0:16:39.97,main,Twain,0,0,0,,It's probably some non-lethal chemical agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:41.93,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.93,0:16:46.23,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,So this is why the Campbell kids' opponents\N earlier seemed slightly off their game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:50.11,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,I'm sure their goal is to weaken us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:52.70,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,How underhanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:16:59.99,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,They locked us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.29,0:17:04.12,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,It's quite simple to open it, but there\N might be a lookout standing guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:07.00,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,and then we'd have to attack a civilian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:09.21,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,I guess we can pretend we fell for their trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:15.15,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,Just in case, let's cover up our skin and \Nclimb the lockers to lessen the damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.72,italics,Twain,0,0,0,,Will you last until they open the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:20.26,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Yes, if it's around ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:24.81,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.81,0:17:29.94,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,We will now begin the finals\N of the 14th Campbelldon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:34.28,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The Phony pair versus... The Campbell siblings!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:36.03,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Everyone has high hopes for the Phony pair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:36.99,top,Audience I,0,0,0,,20,000 on the couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.03,0:17:38.28,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,But will they be able to stop the\N siblings' third victory in a row?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.99,0:17:38.16,top,Audience J,0,0,0,,They're definitely powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:41.04,top,Audience K,0,0,0,,I'm betting my life savings on the Phony pair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:41.04,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The siblings have slightly better \Nodds to win the whole thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:45.53,italics,Campbell,0,0,0,,Yes, just as I planned. \NAll of you fools bet on that couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.53,0:17:48.88,main,Member B,0,0,0,,How amusing. I'll also bet on that couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:50.25,main,Member A,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:53.59,main,Member A,0,0,0,,Of course, I'm assuming you're betting\N on your children, Mr. Campbell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:57.68,main,Campbell,0,0,0,,But of course. I'm betting \Nten million on my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:17:59.35,italics,Campbell,0,0,0,,I'm going to win by a landslide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:02.72,italics,Campbell,0,0,0,,Those two spent a good \Nten minutes soaking up that gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.43,0:18:06.10,italics,Campbell,0,0,0,,You're looking a bit pale. \NAre you feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:10.36,italics,Campbell,0,0,0,,Now, Carrol and Kim... Show them no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:12.61,main,Twain,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:13.86,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I'm still a little numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.86,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I'm also experiencing slight difficulty\N breathing, and my pulse is low.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:18.99,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,I got a message from Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.99,0:18:21.95,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,He said we can stop acting\N like we're struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.95,0:18:25.45,main,Kim,0,0,0,,Hmph. He's so annoying, \Ntrying to dictate our every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.45,0:18:29.33,main,Kim,0,0,0,,Let's bury them already and \Nhave Daddy buy us a new yacht.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:34.05,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,Phony to serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:47.51,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Well, that was weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.82,0:19:00.18,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:03.79,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,And there it is! Carrol's jet-powered racket!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:06.00,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Don't even think about saying this isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:09.05,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,You need proper training to use this baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:18.38,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,A nice hit from the Phony pair!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.38,0:19:20.44,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Will Kim be able to reach it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.02,0:19:34.32,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,And there's the bursting whip racket!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:39.90,main,Kim,0,0,0,,Hmph. I guess they're no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:42.24,top,Crowd,0,0,0,,Yeah! Get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.90,0:19:43.82,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The Campbell siblings are \Nshowing off their noble dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.33,top,Crowd,0,0,0,,I love you, Carrol!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:47.70,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,Game, Campbells!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:51.17,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,Game, Campbells!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.61,0:19:54.25,main,Umpire,0,0,0,,Game, Campbells!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:58.26,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The Campbells totally \Ndominated that first match!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.26,0:20:01.72,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,This is the first set that the \NPhony pair lost this tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.97,0:20:04.48,main,Crowd,0,0,0,,Hey! Play better, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.48,0:20:07.56,main,Crowd,0,0,0,,You should've used a cross \Non that return, you dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:08.77,top,Crowd,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:09.23,main,Crowd,0,0,0,,You've got this, Nafalia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:13.56,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I'm going to remember the faces of every\N single person who ridiculed Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:17.86,main,Campbell,0,0,0,,Sorry, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.99,0:20:28.16,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,We're now entering the second set!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:31.12,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,The Phony pair definitely \Nneeds to win this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:33.50,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,We're starting off the set with Carrol's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:35.88,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:41.13,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,He returned it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.59,0:20:41.77,italicstop,Kim,0,0,0,,It's not a great hit, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.06,0:20:43.52,italics,Kim,0,0,0,,With enough spin...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.89,0:20:52.18,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,That was just a fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:01.27,main,Ump,0,0,0,,Love-30!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:11.16,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,It looks like the Phony pair \Nare getting back into their groove!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:13.41,main,Carrol,0,0,0,,Damn it! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.41,0:21:17.46,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,And before they knew it, the Campbell\N pair had three games taken from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:19.25,italics,Carrol,0,0,0,,If that's how it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:24.72,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Now, will the Phony pair be \Nable to win four games in a row?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:32.06,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:36.12,italics,Commentator,0,0,0,,Nafalia's ball went in an unexpected direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.98,0:21:40.34,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.34,0:21:43.36,main,Twain,0,0,0,,The 36 grooves throughout this court...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.36,0:21:45.77,main,Twain,0,0,0,,They caught my eye, \Nbut now I see their purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.77,0:21:49.69,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I'm certain there are other gimmicks,\N as well. How troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.45,0:21:51.66,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.20,0:21:56.45,main,Twain,0,0,0,,I have no intention of letting them\N win with their petty little tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.74,0:21:59.36,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.65,0:22:04.44,main,Twain,0,0,0,,Nafalia, if you'll support me by keeping\N an eye on our surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.93,0:22:07.56,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,This is the Twilight that I admired.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.56,0:22:10.71,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,The one I wanted to catch up to... \Nand stand beside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.39,0:22:17.63,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,My respect turned into romantic feelings, \Nand his dreams became my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.63,0:22:18.22,italics,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:22.74,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,Wake up, Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.74,0:22:26.58,main,Nafalia,0,0,0,,I will crush them with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.32,0:22:30.03,sign_9163_143_Sis_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an5\fscx200\fscy200\c&H1000D1&\3c&HA0009C&\shad0\bord3\blur4\t(1,152,\3c&H101010&\blur0)}I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.87,0:22:28.92,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.96,0:24:09.96,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(450,285)\fscx58}THE UNWAVERING PATH
